From: Voqii <codylepine4@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 04:15:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] 2.3.16-voqii: lobby items never leave the arena

Leaving the arena world (or quitting in it) now always removes the kit selector, leave clock and other Items.* lobby items. Stock KitPvP only cleared anything with Arena.ClearInventoryOnLeave on (off by default), and 2.3.15's kp.inventory.keep skipped that clear too, so lobby items could be carried into other worlds. Full clears still follow ClearInventoryOnLeave and kp.inventory.keep.
---
